        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5fda72e7-34d8-4449-89eb-79ab705091ae).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rWith the Delgado operation beginning to unravel, one man appears determined to leave before the dust settles.\r\rVanisher, the cartel’s trusted identity forger, has prepared new lives for himself and four associates, along with enough sensitive information to make their disappearance rather profitable.\r\rSomeone would prefer those secrets remain buried in Santa Fortuna.\r\rMake sure none of them get the fresh start they planned.\r\rGood luck, 47.\r\rBy Twiice",
